---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { getMediaAsset } from '../data/media-manifest';

const title = 'Media & Field Notes | USIVA Planning Artifacts';
const description = 'Inspect USIVA visual aids for readiness files, pathway sequencing, authorization boundaries, and source trails.';
const canonical = 'https://usiva.org/media-gallery.html';
const deskPhoto = getMediaAsset('evidence-desk');
---

<BaseLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  activePath="/media-gallery.html"
  canonical={canonical}
  topbarMessage="Planning artifacts are prompts · official sources control the answer."
  topbarLink={{ label: 'Open official tools', href: '/official-tools.html' }}
>
  <section class="gallery-intro" aria-labelledby="page-title">
    <div class="shell-container gallery-intro__grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Media / planning artifacts</p>
        <h1 id="page-title">Four visual aids for visa and immigration planning.</h1>
        <p class="gallery-intro__lede">USIVA uses simple visual aids to make a readiness file, pathway sequence, authorization boundary, or source trail easier to inspect. Each artifact points to a planning action and the official source that owns the live answer.</p>
        <nav class="intro-actions" aria-label="Media gallery next steps">
          <a class="button button--primary" href="#gallery">Enter the gallery</a>
          <a class="button button--outline" href="/services.html">Use the planning map</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
      <figure class="gallery-photo">
        <img
          src={deskPhoto.src}
          width={deskPhoto.width}
          height={deskPhoto.height}
          alt={deskPhoto.alt}
          sizes="(min-width: 900px) 38vw, 100vw"
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high"
        />
        <figcaption>{deskPhoto.caption}</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section gallery-context" aria-labelledby="context-heading">
    <div class="shell-container gallery-context__grid">
      <p class="folio">FIELD STUDY<br /><span>01</span></p>
      <div class="flow">
        <p class="eyebrow">Why visual aids</p>
        <h2 id="context-heading">A picture helps organize the next question.</h2>
        <p>This gallery presents a small set of reusable planning metaphors: a file you can sort, a path you can sequence, a boundary you can name, and a source trail you can revisit.</p>
        <p>Use the captions. They describe the role and the limit of each artifact.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section gallery-wall" id="gallery" aria-labelledby="gallery-heading">
    <div class="shell-container">
      <header class="wall-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">The wall</p>
        <h2 id="gallery-heading">Four ways to see the next question.</h2>
      </header>

      <div class="artifact-grid">
        <figure class="artifact-card">
          <div class="artifact artifact-file" role="img" aria-label="A planning file with identity, academic, and funding sections">
            <span class="artifact-label">READINESS FILE</span>
            <strong>Before the deadline</strong>
            <div class="artifact-rule artifact-rule--long"></div>
            <div class="artifact-rule artifact-rule--short"></div>
            <div class="artifact-tags"><span>IDENTITY</span><span>ACADEMIC</span><span>FUNDING</span></div>
            <small>CHECK · DATE · ASK</small>
          </div>
          <figcaption><strong>01 / The readiness file</strong><span>Sort records by the decision they support, then confirm the required list with the relevant school, sponsor, or authority.</span></figcaption>
        </figure>

        <figure class="artifact-card">
          <div class="artifact artifact-path" role="img" aria-label="A three-step pathway from prepare to verify to hand off">
            <span class="artifact-label">PATHWAY · PLANNING PROMPT</span>
            <div class="path-steps"><strong>PREPARE</strong><i aria-hidden="true"></i><strong>VERIFY</strong><i aria-hidden="true"></i><strong>HAND OFF</strong></div>
            <div class="path-foot"><span>file</span><span>source</span><span>owner</span></div>
          </div>
          <figcaption><strong>02 / The pathway map</strong><span>Sequence the next handoff instead of jumping to an outcome. The sequence changes when the program, status, location, or facts change.</span></figcaption>
        </figure>

        <figure class="artifact-card">
          <div class="artifact artifact-boundary" role="img" aria-label="Three lanes labeled study, research, and work meeting an ask first marker">
            <span class="artifact-label">ACTIVITY · ASK FIRST</span>
            <div class="boundary-row"><strong>STUDY</strong><span></span></div>
            <div class="boundary-row"><strong>RESEARCH</strong><span></span></div>
            <div class="boundary-row"><strong>WORK</strong><span></span></div>
            <b class="ask-marker">ASK<br />FIRST</b>
          </div>
          <figcaption><strong>03 / The authorization boundary</strong><span>Separate activities and ask the responsible authority to verify the permission before an activity begins.</span></figcaption>
        </figure>

        <figure class="artifact-card">
          <div class="artifact artifact-source" role="img" aria-label="A source trail connecting a public source to local instructions and a specialist question">
            <span class="artifact-label">SOURCE TRAIL</span>
            <div class="source-stack"><strong>PUBLIC SOURCE</strong><i aria-hidden="true"></i><strong>LOCAL INSTRUCTION</strong><i aria-hidden="true"></i><strong>SPECIALIST QUESTION</strong></div>
            <small>CHECKED · DATE · FIT</small>
          </div>
          <figcaption><strong>04 / The source trail</strong><span>Keep the source, date, and fit visible. A public page may orient you while a school, sponsor, agency, or attorney controls the answer.</span></figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section gallery-reading" aria-labelledby="reading-heading">
    <div class="shell-container gallery-reading__grid">
      <header>
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">How to use the wall</p>
        <h2 id="reading-heading">Notice what the artifacts refuse to claim.</h2>
      </header>
      <ol>
        <li><span>01</span><p><strong>Evidence stays sourced.</strong> The artifacts organize records, questions, and source ownership for a careful review.</p></li>
        <li><span>02</span><p><strong>Sources stay primary.</strong> The drawings point readers to current official or program instructions.</p></li>
        <li><span>03</span><p><strong>Handoffs stay clear.</strong> When facts become personal, the next step is a responsible authority or licensed counsel.</p></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section gallery-next" aria-labelledby="next-heading">
    <div class="shell-container">
      <header>
        <p class="eyebrow">Take the artifact with you</p>
        <h2 id="next-heading">Turn a visual prompt into a verified question.</h2>
        <p>Choose the planning page that matches the artifact you need: file, route, boundary, or source.</p>
      </header>
      <ul class="next-links">
        <li><a href="/services.html"><strong>Open services</strong><span>Use a planning lane for the question in front of you.</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="/articles.html"><strong>Read articles</strong><span>Follow a longer explanation of the underlying issue.</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="/briefs.html"><strong>Review research briefs</strong><span>Start with a short source-led note.</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="/official-tools.html"><strong>Check official tools</strong><span>Move from visual prompt to controlling source.</span></a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .gallery-intro {
    background: var(--color-mist);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-line);
  }

  .gallery-intro__grid {
    align-items: end;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(18rem, 0.78fr);
    padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
  }

  .gallery-intro h1 {
    max-width: 17ch;
  }

  .gallery-intro__lede {
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    margin-block-start: var(--space-2);
    max-width: 58ch;
  }

  .intro-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-1);
    margin-block-start: var(--space-3);
  }

  .gallery-photo {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .gallery-photo img {
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    object-fit: cover;
    width: 100%;
  }

  figcaption {
    border-inline-start: 2px solid var(--color-gold);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    display: grid;
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    gap: 0.35rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    margin-block-start: var(--space-1);
    padding-inline-start: var(--space-1);
  }

  .gallery-context__grid,
  .gallery-reading__grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.3fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
  }

  .gallery-context__grid > div {
    max-width: 64ch;
  }

  .gallery-context h2,
  .wall-heading h2,
  .gallery-reading h2,
  .gallery-next h2 {
    max-width: 25ch;
  }

  .folio {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--step--2);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .folio span {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    margin-block-start: 0.35rem;
  }

  .gallery-wall {
    background: var(--color-paper);
  }

  .wall-heading {
    max-width: 54rem;
  }

  .artifact-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    margin-block-start: var(--space-3);
  }

  .artifact-card {
    background: var(--color-mist);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    margin: 0;
    padding: var(--space-1);
  }

  .artifact {
    min-height: 17rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: var(--space-3);
    position: relative;
  }

  .artifact-file {
    background: var(--color-highlight-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-gold);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-1);
    justify-content: end;
  }

  .artifact-label,
  .artifact small,
  .path-foot,
  .source-stack,
  .boundary-row {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--step--2);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .artifact-label {
    color: var(--color-accent-dark);
  }

  .artifact-file > strong {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    line-height: 1.05;
    max-width: 12ch;
  }

  .artifact-rule {
    height: 0.45rem;
  }

  .artifact-rule--long {
    background: var(--color-navy);
    width: 78%;
  }

  .artifact-rule--short {
    background: var(--color-gold);
    width: 43%;
  }

  .artifact-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .artifact-tags span {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-line-dark);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--step--2);
    padding: 0.35rem 0.45rem;
  }

  .artifact-file small,
  .artifact-source small {
    color: var(--color-accent-dark);
  }

  .artifact-path {
    background: var(--color-success-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-success);
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .path-steps {
    align-items: center;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr;
    margin-block: auto;
  }

  .path-steps strong {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--step--2);
  }

  .path-steps i {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    display: block;
    height: 1px;
    position: relative;
    width: 2rem;
  }

  .path-steps i::after {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    content: '›';
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    position: absolute;
    right: -0.2rem;
    top: -0.75rem;
  }

  .path-foot {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-success);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-block-start: var(--space-1);
  }

  .artifact-boundary {
    background: var(--color-mist);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-line-dark);
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .boundary-row {
    align-items: center;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    grid-template-columns: 5rem minmax(0, 1fr);
  }

  .boundary-row strong {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-size: var(--step--2);
  }

  .boundary-row span {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--color-gold) 0 42%, transparent 42%);
    border-block: 1px solid var(--color-line-dark);
    display: block;
    height: 0.7rem;
  }

  .ask-marker {
    align-items: center;
    background: var(--color-paper);
    border: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
    border-radius: 50%;
    bottom: var(--space-2);
    color: var(--color-accent-dark);
    display: grid;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--step--2);
    height: 4.5rem;
    justify-items: center;
    line-height: 1;
    position: absolute;
    right: var(--space-2);
    width: 4.5rem;
  }

  .artifact-source {
    background: var(--color-error-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-error);
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .source-stack {
    align-content: center;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    justify-items: start;
    margin-block: auto;
  }

  .source-stack strong {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    padding: 0.55rem 0.65rem;
  }

  .source-stack strong:nth-of-type(2) {
    margin-inline-start: 1rem;
  }

  .source-stack strong:nth-of-type(3) {
    background: var(--color-gold);
    color: var(--color-paper);
    margin-inline-start: 2rem;
  }

  .source-stack i {
    border-inline-start: 1px dashed var(--color-accent);
    height: 0.8rem;
    margin-inline-start: 1rem;
  }

  .artifact-card figcaption {
    border: 0;
    padding-block: var(--space-1) 0;
  }

  .artifact-card figcaption strong {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-size: var(--step-0);
  }

  .gallery-reading {
    background: var(--color-navy);
    color: var(--color-paper);
  }

  .gallery-reading h2 {
    color: var(--color-paper);
  }

  .gallery-reading__grid {
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.7fr) minmax(0, 1.3fr);
  }

  .gallery-reading ol {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    list-style: none;
  }

  .gallery-reading li {
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    grid-template-columns: 2.2rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    padding-block: var(--space-2);
  }

  .gallery-reading li > span {
    color: var(--color-paper);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
  }

  .gallery-reading p {
    color: var(--color-on-dark-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .gallery-reading strong {
    color: var(--color-paper);
  }

  .gallery-next {
    background: var(--color-mist);
  }

  .gallery-next > div > header {
    max-width: 58rem;
  }

  .next-links {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    list-style: none;
    margin-block-start: var(--space-3);
  }

  .next-links li {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-line);
  }

  .next-links a {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.3rem 1.5rem;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(12rem, 0.5fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    padding-block: var(--space-2);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .next-links strong {
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .next-links span {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .gallery-intro__grid,
    .gallery-context__grid,
    .gallery-reading__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .gallery-photo {
      max-width: 42rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .intro-actions .button {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .artifact-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .path-steps {
      align-items: start;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .path-steps i {
      height: 1.1rem;
      margin-inline-start: 0.4rem;
      width: 1px;
    }

    .path-steps i::after {
      right: auto;
      top: 0.6rem;
    }

    .next-links a {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
